ADDITIONAL NOTES

CAD geometry
  The CAD files in cad/ were produced as University of Bristol coursework
  (unit CADE20005, AVDASI 2, 2024-25) under academic supervision. They are
  published here for portfolio and educational purposes. Subassemblies other
  than JointsAndFairings were authored by other student teams within the same
  company; authorship is attributed in cad/README.md.

Academic integrity
  This is submitted coursework. It is published so that others can see how the
  work was done. Submitting any part of it as your own work for assessment is
  plagiarism, and university plagiarism detection will find it.

Third-party material
  Teaching material reproduced in the original technical report under academic
  fair dealing has been excluded from this repository. Figures here are the
  team's own work.
